{"who":"Margaret","text":"I can sort the gate latch Saturday if you like. Got the new catch from the hardware shop on Oystermouth Road","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T09:20","checkin":"2026-12-10T09:20"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"It's the latch that sticks, not the hinge. A bit of oil and it might do","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T09:24","checkin":"2026-12-10T09:24"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Saturday's fine. Morning or afternoon","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:02","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:02"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Morning. Before the rugby on the telly","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:05","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:05"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Morning suits. I'll leave the side gate open so you can get at it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:09","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:09"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Don't need it open, I'll come through the back","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:11","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:11"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Bin day tomorrow. Yours or mine out first","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T13:40","checkin":"2026-12-10T13:40"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Mine's out already. You're on next week, it's on the fridge","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T13:52","checkin":"2026-12-10T13:52"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Did you put my bottle back. The green one","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T14:15","checkin":"2026-12-10T14:15"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Yes it's by your back door","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T14:20","checkin":"2026-12-10T14:20"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Ta","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T19:33","checkin":"2026-12-10T19:33"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Is the latch the one with the little brass plate or the plain one","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T21:48","checkin":"2026-12-10T21:48"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"The plain one. The brass plate went years ago","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T08:14","checkin":"2026-12-11T08:14"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Shed might have the old one if you'd rather","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T08:15","checkin":"2026-12-11T08:15"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Plain one's what I got. I'll try it Saturday","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T09:03","checkin":"2026-12-11T09:03"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"I've got oil","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T09:04","checkin":"2026-12-11T09:04"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Lorry's been. Left the recycling box on its side by the wall","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T13:22","checkin":"2026-12-11T13:22"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Saw. I'll stand it up","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T13:30","checkin":"2026-12-11T13:30"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Rugby's on Saturday 2 o'clock if you're after it. Wales in Cardiff, not that I expect you to care","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T19:58","checkin":"2026-12-11T19:58"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Latch won't take all day. Morning first, then you can have your rugby","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T20:11","checkin":"2026-12-11T20:11"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Right","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T22:40","checkin":"2026-12-11T22:40"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Coming through the back in ten minutes. Is the gate still propped with the bread crate","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T08:47","checkin":"2026-12-12T08:47"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Crate's gone. Leave the back door on the latch, I'm in the front room","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T08:52","checkin":"2026-12-12T08:52"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Catch is in. Doesn't line up with the old hole, the screws are the wrong length","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T09:31","checkin":"2026-12-12T09:31"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Shed. Top shelf left of the door, tin with the nails in","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T09:33","checkin":"2026-12-12T09:33"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Found a tin of something that might be nails. Some of it is bolts","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T09:40","checkin":"2026-12-12T09:40"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Bolts will do if they're the short ones","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T09:41","checkin":"2026-12-12T09:41"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Short ones work. Gate closes now. Latch catches on the second go, mind","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T09:58","checkin":"2026-12-12T09:58"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Second go is fine. First go was never fine","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T10:03","checkin":"2026-12-12T10:03"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Oiled the hinge while I was at it. Didn't need to but it was there","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T10:20","checkin":"2026-12-12T10:20"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Kettle's on if you want to come round","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T10:24","checkin":"2026-12-12T10:24"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Give me five minutes","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T10:25","checkin":"2026-12-12T10:25"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Back home","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T12:50","checkin":"2026-12-12T12:50"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Kick off. Can hear your telly through the wall, you've got it louder than me","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T14:03","checkin":"2026-12-12T14:03"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"I'm not watching it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T14:11","checkin":"2026-12-12T14:11"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"You're watching it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T14:12","checkin":"2026-12-12T14:12"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Radio on, that's different","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T14:12","checkin":"2026-12-12T14:12"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Full time. Not going to say","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T16:40","checkin":"2026-12-12T16:40"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Didn't ask","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T16:44","checkin":"2026-12-12T16:44"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Right","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T16:44","checkin":"2026-12-12T16:44"}
{"who":"Margaret","text":"Side gate's shut and latched. Your end","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T21:15","checkin":"2026-12-12T21:15"}
{"who":"Dennis","text":"Got it. Ta","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-12T21:31","checkin":"2026-12-12T21:31"}
